.env

# Shared squad coordination state. Untracked by design: there is one physical
# jobs/ directory (in the main repo) symlinked into every worktree, so tracking
# it would turn every status update into a merge conflict and would dirty the
# working tree the orchestrator needs clean before it merges. No trailing slash
# so this also matches the symlink git sees in each worktree.
/jobs
